# AuraFlow Web — configuration
#
# CANONICAL_BASE_URL
# The canonical origin (+ optional subpath) of the deployed site.
# Used for: canonical <link>, Open Graph URLs, sitemap.xml, robots.txt.
#
# GitHub Pages (project site) default:
CANONICAL_BASE_URL=https://heyitssuzain.github.io/File-Organizer-Web/
#
# If you deploy to a custom domain or the repo root, change it, e.g.:
# CANONICAL_BASE_URL=https://auraflow.app/
#
# BASE (Vite public base path — must match the subpath above)
# For GitHub Pages project sites keep the default from vite.config.ts
# ("/File-Organizer-Web/"). For a custom domain set BASE=/ .
